			(property "Description" "ST4SIM-200M GSMA eSIM SoC, VFDFPN8 5x6mm wettable-flank (MFF2). Pin table (Figure 12/Table 4) + PCB integration rec. (Figure 6 VCC filtering, Figure 13 20k I/O pull-up) verified against ST data brief DB4082 Rev5 (Jan 2021), fetched via web.archive.org after live st.com/mouser.com fetches were blocked/timed out -- flagged in task-11-report.md. Package pinout is physical pin 1-8 (Figure 12), NOT the logical C1-C8 D16-micromodule contact numbering (Table 8, a DIFFERENT physical card-format variant of the same die) the task brief assumed -- corrected here. 3 pins unused/NC (SWIO=2, NC=4, NC=5), not 2 as the brief guessed."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
