			(property "Description" "TI TPD4S009 4-channel +-8kV IEC61000-4-2 ESD TVS diode array, SOT-23-6 (DBV). Pin table (Sec.5 Pin Configuration and Functions, SOT column) verified against datasheet SLVS817G (Jun 2015 rev, ti.com); not on stock KiCad libs -- authored Task 11. VCC pin is optional (Sec.9: biases internal clamp for a known startup voltage, no ESD-performance effect) -- tied to the protected line's own VDD net here (design choice, disclosed in task-11-report.md)."
