			(property "Description" "TI TS3A27518E bidirectional 6-channel 1:2 mux/demux, TSSOP-24 (PW). Pin table (Table 5-1, PW column) + Table 8-1 truth table verified against datasheet SCDS260F (Dec 2021 rev, ti.com); not on stock KiCad libs -- authored Task 11. IN1 controls COM1/2/3<->NC1/2/3|NO1/2/3, IN2 controls COM4/5/6<->NC4/5/6|NO4/5/6; per Table 8-1, IN=L(with EN=L) selects NC side ON / NO side OFF, IN=H selects NO side ON / NC side OFF (EN=H disables all channels -- tied EN=GND here)."
